<title>HONG KONG: REUTERS 1ST EX-HK TRANS-PACIFIC AIR CARGO MKT.</title>
<headline>REUTERS 1ST EX-HK TRANS-PACIFIC AIR CARGO MKT.</headline>
<text>
<p>HONG KONG (Reuter) Jan 23 - Current average ex-Hong Kong air cargo market rates in Hong Kong dollars per kg for a 100kg shipment, with volume-to-weight of six to one.</p>
<p>		     JAN 23		    DEC 13</p>
<p>				   USA</p>
<p>HKG-JFK	   19.06			18.70</p>
<p>HKG-LAX	   18.43			18.20</p>
<p>				  JAPAN</p>
<p>HKG-NRT	   14.30			 14.60</p>
<p>* The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuters journalists on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, large forwarders and smaller cargo agents.</p>
<p>* All prices were quoted in Hong Kong dollars.</p>
<p>* The tariffs represent average rates calculated by from a range of prices and are indicative of current market activity.</p>
<p>--Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 8982 Fax +44 171 542 5017</p>
